          .proof
            %h6#proof_4 Proof
            %p
              According to the yoga of (Lawvere)
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lawvere+theory"} algebraic theories
              = succeed "-ary" do
